his grandkids money on Venmo.

00:06:23.116 --> 00:06:24.517
-Aww.
[ Audience awws ]

00:06:24.517 --> 00:06:26.418
-Yeah, again,
this is in that boring book

00:06:26.418 --> 00:06:28.020
