were able to find his account.

00:06:32.325 --> 00:06:33.993
Yeah.

00:06:33.993 --> 00:06:35.194
What?

00:06:35.194 --> 00:06:36.796
[ Laughter ]
Yeah.

00:06:36.796 --> 00:06:38.197
[ Laughter ]

00:06:38.197 --> 00:06:39.298
What?
-What?

00:06:39.298 --> 00:06:40.799
What?
-Yeah.

00:06:40.799 --> 00:06:42.702
-Yeah-ah.
-Yeah-ah.

00:06:42.702 --> 00:06:44.237
-What?

00:06:44.237 --> 00:06:47.173
[ Laughter ]

00:06:47.173 --> 00:06:49.742
He's not alone -- a lot of
people in Washington use Venmo.

00:06:49.742 --> 00:06:51.643
And you can see exactly
what they're doing.

00:06:51.643 --> 00:06:52.912
