-Yeah, for instance,

00:06:52.912 --> 00:06:55.814
let me show you --
Senator John Hoeven

00:06:55.814 --> 00:06:58.284
sent Senator Angus King $50
for...

00:07:01.586 --> 00:07:03.055
-Wow.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:07:03.055 --> 00:07:05.057
He's paying back an old debt.
-He's paying back an old debt.

00:07:05.057 --> 00:07:06.259
-Yeah.
-Yeah.

00:07:06.259 --> 00:07:08.127
-By using a modern...
-And then, next up,

00:07:08.127 --> 00:07:10.263
Senator Mark Kelly...
-What? Yeah.

00:07:10.263 --> 00:07:13.366
-...sent Senator Rand Paul $15
for...

00:07:14.833 --> 00:07:16.268
[ Slide whistle plays notes ]
-Oh.

00:07:16.268 --> 00:07:17.803
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:07:17.803 --> 00:07:19.238
-[ Imitates slide whistle ]

00:07:19.238 --> 00:07:21.173
Next up, Senator James Lankford

00:07:21.173 --> 00:07:24.010
sent Senator Ron Wyden $60
for...

00:07:25.911 --> 00:07:27.880
-Oh.
[ Laughter ]

00:07:27.880 --> 00:07:30.115
-Wow.
-Here's another one here,

00:07:30.115 --> 00:07:34.487
Senator Gary Peters sent
Congressman Don Young $3 for...

00:07:36.188 --> 00:07:37.323
[ Laughter ]

00:07:37.323 --> 00:07:39.058
Isn't that unbelievable?
-Wow.

00:07:39.058 --> 00:07:40.325
[ Laughter ]

00:07:40.325 --> 00:07:43.829
-And then...
[ Laughter ]

00:07:43.829 --> 00:07:45.197
Can you imagine that?

00:07:45.197 --> 00:07:46.866
-No, it's crazy.
-Ah!

00:07:46.866 --> 00:07:48.167
Next up, Senator Joe --

00:07:48.167 --> 00:07:51.003
[ Laughter ]
-Charged him $3 for that.

00:07:51.003 --> 00:07:52.137
-He charged him $3...
-Yeah.

00:07:52.137 --> 00:07:53.439
-...just to see
if he could do it.

00:07:53.439 --> 00:07:54.607
-"Hey, you can do it?"
-"Hey, can you unlock..."

00:07:54.607 --> 00:07:56.876
-Yeah. You think it was,
