This is, like, all coming up.

00:08:19.531 --> 00:08:20.599
BuzzFeed's finding out
all of this.

00:08:20.599 --> 00:08:22.268
-Yeah.
-Up next,

00:08:22.268 --> 00:08:26.305
Congressman Thomas Massie sent
Senator Jim Inhofe $100 for...

00:08:29.041 --> 00:08:30.108
[ Laughter ]

00:08:30.108 --> 00:08:32.578
And, finally,
Congressman Brad Sherman

00:08:32.578 --> 00:08:34.947
